WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,600
Yes

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:11,150
Don't show this thing to others. Two days at most. I will give you news and wait for your news.

3
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,140
Tiger is indeed a bombshell

4
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:31,340
It depends on what price the people behind Gao Jianshe can charge. I know you are good, have money, food, vegetables and fish.

5
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,260
Home is becoming more and more like home

6
00:00:33,970 --> 00:00:34,930
Wait for the tiger to take action

7
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,090
Building a house

8
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:37,250
can be put on the agenda

9
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:42,110
You white-eyed wolf

10
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:43,050
Come out to me

11
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:46,330
Everyone from our old Qin family is here. How dare you not open the door?

12
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,650
I heard that you got good things from hunting and ate poisonous food yourself.

13
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:50,730
I don’t know how to break down the door to show respect to the elders
